# L §6.1 Shared law: two members copying one law part with the same versions (pit_2025 in both) are not refused: each
# member stays closed and reads its own copy (a.rate, c.rate).
=== J/joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "../A" sha256 "4a2c937a217bc98027215d3c8f76ea54b565d5e8738267fd7bf2268d8d5c04ed"
  use c = "../C" sha256 "eb365491d24abf193947ef44eaccf6c5c4e448676ad35a1cfc66907bca4f0f2a"

ask r: a.rate + c.rate law 2026-06-01
=== A/reality.tally
model ma
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
=== A/law/pit.tally
part pit
  tally 2
  law

source act "ustawa"

input rate: num

version pit_2025
  cite act
  governs 2025-01-01..
  known 2024-12-01
  rate = 0.12 "art. 1"
=== C/reality.tally
model mc
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
=== C/law/pit.tally
part pit
  tally 2
  law

source act "ustawa"

input rate: num

version pit_2025
  cite act
  governs 2025-01-01..
  known 2024-12-01
  rate = 0.12 "art. 1"
=== expect
r: 0.24
  law date 2026-06-01, cut 2026-10-20
